{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"综合能源","country":"马来西亚","country_iso":"MYS","created_at":"2026-03-23T10:13:59.967730","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"MYS-HB-0010","ldc":"No","location":"登嘉楼","location_norm":"登嘉楼州","name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"马来西亚登嘉楼100MW混合太阳能项目","project_name_en":"Malaysia 100MW Hybrid Solar Project (Merchang, Terengganu)","subcategory":null},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"电力时代","content":"Trinasolar 是智能光伏 (PV) 和储能解决方案领域的全球领导者，该公司计划将其混合太阳能项目扩展到东南亚。此前，该公司已成功启动了马来西亚最大的混合太阳能项目，即位于登嘉楼 Merchang 的一座 100MWac 发电厂。\n该项目由 Cypark Resources Berhad 实施，采用 35MW 浮动太阳能电池板和 65MW 地面安装太阳能电池板的组合。预计每年可抵消 202,024 吨二氧化碳排放量。浮动太阳能部分位于海边的湖泊上，受益于水的冷却效果和减少的水蒸发，而地面安装系统则利用了白色沙质土壤的反射特性。\n天合光能东南亚区负责人王总对该项目的成功表示赞赏，并强调该地区类似的大型混合太阳能项目具有重大机遇。王总\n该电站采用天合光能的 Vertex 590-595W 双面组件，该组件以在高湿度和高盐度沿海环境中的耐用性而闻名。这些组件因其在严苛条件下的性能而获得了德国莱茵 TÜV 的认可。其双面设计通过从两侧捕获阳光来提高发电量，而高达 21.4% 的高效率有助于降低能源成本。\nCypark Resources 执行主席 Dato' Ami Moris 强调了该项目的重要性。Moris 表示：“这是马来西亚最大的混合太阳能发电厂，展示了我们将太阳能与登嘉楼自然环境相结合的能力。”\n天合光能致力于推进混合太阳能技术，支持东南亚的可再生能源目标，与马来西亚到 2050 年实现 70% 可再生能源结构的目标保持一致。王总总结道：“我们期待推动更多此类举措，为该地区的可再生能源目标做出贡献。”","content_sha256":"9935edc4093a245dc7a3a72d0ffa2f29494acf65364134c5f595f4ecb9b77789","id":7270,"publish_date":"2024-08-13 18:45:48","title":"天合光能拿下马来西亚最大项目后，又将混合太阳能项目拓展至东南亚","title_sha256":"d444f035c809980540f1e7ebb4468d12b4a8622b8b75b475297c6ee4e706e14e","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/69919.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"MYS-HB-0010","capacity_details":"PV: 100MW","capacity_mw":100.0,"capacity_mw_raw":"100","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T10:13:59.967953","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"MYS-HB-0010-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[]","official_website_links":"[\"https://www.trinasolar.com/cn/resources/newsroom/fri-20240906-2000/\"]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"Cypark Resources Berhad","project_developer_en":"Cypark Resources Berhad","project_stage":"投入运营","project_summary":"天合光能作为设备供应商，参与了马来西亚登嘉楼Merchang一座100MWac的混合太阳能发电项目。该项目由Cypark Resources Berhad实施，采用浮动和地面安装太阳能电池板组合，是马来西亚最大的混合太阳能项目之一。","publish_date":"2024-08-13 18:45:48","pv_capacity_mw":100.0,"source_links":"[\"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/69919.html\"]","storage_energy_mwh":null,"storage_power_mw":null,"total_investment_usd":null,"total_investment_usd_raw":"","transmission_capacity_mw":null,"verification_confidence":null,"verification_sources":null,"verification_status":"unverified","voltage_kv":null}}],"evidence_policy":{"exact_quote_required":true,"quote_must_not_cross_surfaces":true,"valid_surfaces":["title","body"]},"project_id":"MYS-HB-0010","schema_version":"storage-taxonomy-evidence-package-v1","selection_reasons":["active_hybrid_category","storage_text_signal"]}
